<!--
  ============================================================================
  WildAnimals_NightsideIce.xml              UtinniPatches — new file 2026-09-24
  ============================================================================

  Wires the one Star Wars canon row (Q11a, owner ruling 2026-09-22: a genuinely
  canon name is IP and must route through the Utinni campaign patch layer, never
  the franchise-free RimMandrake tier) onto RM_NightsideIce. The other 7 rows
